  "notes": [
    "If someone navigated in the Dashboard before its first data load finished",
    "(a sidebar click, opening a repo from Fleet, Back), the page finished loading",
    "afterwards and switched to Welcome anyway. Users could lose their first",
    "click on a slow machine. On Windows CI this was one confirmed cause of the",
    "intermittent Dashboard UI failures (#70): the Repo file tree never appeared",
    "because Welcome had replaced it.",
    "The page now keeps whatever view was chosen during loading and re-renders it",
    "once the data arrives. With no navigation, the landing view is unchanged. A"
